# Specification applicability scopes

## Rule

Specifications MUST distinguish `corporate`, `departmental` and `project` scope. Corporate and departmental policy may be centrally maintained and resolved without copying it into every project. Project specifications remain project-owned. Physical storage and retrieval may differ from logical applicability.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
